<title>SINGAPORE: IPC 1H net profit down 85 pct.</title>
<headline>IPC 1H net profit down 85 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		     5.32   vs  35.42</p>
<p>    Group shares (cents)	 0.53   vs   3.54</p>
<p>    Turnover			 738.43  vs 833.84</p>
