<p>    Interest expense		 4.46  vs   2.99</p>
<p>    Pretax profit		    4.67  vs  38.91</p>
<p>    Tax				  0.10  vs   1.99</p>
<p>    Minorities			 0.74  vs  (1.51)</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries		 19.32  vs    nil</p>
<p>Note- Full name is IPC Corp Ltd.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
